(=== Section 1.0 - Purpose and Scope ===) Tj T*
(DOCUMENT CODE: SOP-FIN-001 | DEPARTMENT: Finance & Accounts Payable) Tj T*
(TITLE: Enterprise Accounts Payable Invoice Processing SOP) Tj T*
(OWNER: VP of Finance Operations | EFFECTIVE DATE: 2026-01-15) Tj T*
(1.0 Purpose: Standardize receipt, OCR extraction, 3-way PO matching, approval routing, and ERP payment posting for vendor invoices.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=== Section 2.0 - Process Activities and Execution Rules ===) Tj T*
(Step 1 [ACT-001] Receive and Digitize Vendor Invoice | Role: AP Intake Specialist \(Finance & Accounts Payable\) | Type: manual) Tj T*
(Description: Receive vendor PDF or paper invoice via AP portal and register invoice batch metadata.) Tj T*
(Input: Raw Vendor Invoice, Delivery Receipt | Output: Registered Invoice Record) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Vendor is active in Master Vendor Registry | Postconditions: Invoice assigned unique tracking ID) Tj T*
(Dependencies: None) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 2 [ACT-002] Execute Automated OCR and Three-Way PO Match | Role: ERP Matching Engine \(Finance Systems\) | Type: automated) Tj T*
(Description: Extract line items via OCR and perform automated 3-way match against Purchase Order and Goods Receipt Note within 2% tolerance.) Tj T*
(Input: Registered Invoice Record, Purchase Order, Goods Receipt Note | Output: Three-Way Match Report) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Invoice tracking ID exists and PO reference is present | Postconditions: Match variance percentage calculated) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-001) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 3 [ACT-003] Evaluate Match Discrepancy and Variance Threshold | Role: AP Senior Analyst \(Finance & Accounts Payable\) | Type: decision) Tj T*
(Description: Decision gate evaluating if 3-way match variance is within 2% tolerance and whether invoice amount exceeds $10,000 approval threshold.) Tj T*
(Input: Three-Way Match Report | Output: Routing Decision Signal) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Three-Way Match Report generated | Postconditions: Invoice routed to approval gate, auto-posting, or discrepancy escalation) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-002) Tj T*
(DECISION RULE [COND-001]: IF match_variance <= 2% AND invoice_amount >= $10,000 THEN route to ACT-004 ELSE IF match_variance <= 2% AND invoice_amount < $10,000 THEN route to ACT-005.) Tj T*
(EXCEPTION RULE [EXC-001]: IF match_variance > 2% OR missing Goods Receipt Note THEN escalate to Procurement Dispute Specialist within 24 hours \(Target: ACT-006\). Remediation: Issue Vendor Debit Memo or PO Amendment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
