(=== Section 3.0 - Approvals, Exception Handling, and Settlement ===) Tj T*
(Step 4 [ACT-004] Approve High-Value Invoice Settlement | Role: Finance Controller \(Executive Finance\) | Type: approval) Tj T*
(Description: Review supporting audit package and approve invoices valued at $10,000 or above.) Tj T*
(Input: Routing Decision Signal, Three-Way Match Report | Output: Signed Payment Authorization) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Invoice amount >= $10,000 and 3-way match verified | Postconditions: Payment authorization token recorded in ERP) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-003) Tj T*
(APPROVAL GATE [APR-001]: Approver: Finance Controller | Criteria: Budget availability and valid 3-way match for invoices >= $10,000 | SLA: 16 hours | Rejection Target: ACT-006.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 5 [ACT-005] Post General Ledger Entry and Schedule ACH Payment | Role: ERP Treasury Scheduler \(Finance Systems\) | Type: automated) Tj T*
(Description: Post balanced liability journal to General Ledger and schedule Net-30 ACH payment run.) Tj T*
(Input: Signed Payment Authorization, Registered Invoice Record | Output: GL Journal Voucher, ACH Payment Instruction) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Either Finance Controller approval obtained or auto-approved \(< $10,000\) | Postconditions: Payment scheduled and vendor notified) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-003, ACT-004) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 6 [ACT-006] Resolve PO Discrepancy with Vendor and Procurement | Role: Procurement Dispute Specialist \(Procurement\) | Type: escalation) Tj T*
(Description: Investigate quantity or price variance > 2% with buyer and supplier, issuing credit note request or invoice rejection.) Tj T*
(Input: Three-Way Match Report, Discrepancy Alert | Output: Discrepancy Resolution Memo) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Match variance > 2% or controller rejection | Postconditions: Invoice placed on hold or credit memo received) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-003) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
